{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Draw near to the altar.</b> Because all seven days of ordination Moses officiated, and on the eighth Moses said to Aaron: from now on, you draw near and officiate." "<b>And make atonement for yourself.</b> And afterwards for the people — so that the meritorious one may come and make atonement for the liable one, for he and they sinned in the calf."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:10:53.939900413Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}